{%- comment -%}
  Instagram / social gallery — site-structure.md §8.7: "#florista".
  Reworked 2026-08-31 with the owner (design-log entry of the same date).

  Was: six Unsplash placeholders hardcoded in a Liquid array — not editable,
  not Florista's flowers, and linking nowhere (no confirmed handle existed).
  The 2026-08-30 audit flagged that as a trust defect (A7 class).

  Now: six theme-editor tiles. Each tile is a block with an image picker, so
  swapping a photo is click-tile → pick image → save — the owner asked for exactly
  that ("super easy to swap") because the seeded campaign shots are AI-made
  and he may replace them with real Instagram photos. A tile with no image
  chosen falls back, by position, to a bundled default: three campaign shots
  he picked (home-insta-camp1..3) and three real catalog packshots
  (paris / tehila / tropical). Deliberately a static grid, not a live feed:
  Meta retired the simple feed API, feed apps cost money and tokens, their
  JS drags mobile speed, and injected images carry no alt for search.

  The handle is real and confirmed by the owner: instagram.com/floristahaifa —
  tiles and the follow link go there (block link can point at a single post).
{%- endcomment -%}

{{ 'florista-instagram.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}

{%- liquid
  assign profile_url = section.settings.profile_url | default: 'https://www.instagram.com/floristahaifa/'

  # Positional fallbacks for tiles whose block has no image picked.
  # Alt text is honest: campaign imagery says קמפיין, product shots name the product.
  # Order alternates product / model — the owner, 2026-09-01 ("mix it out a lil bit"),
  # who also swapped the vase bouquet (תהילה) for מנגינה קיצית.
  assign default_assets = 'home-insta-paris,home-insta-camp1,home-insta-melody,home-insta-camp2,home-insta-tropical,home-insta-camp3' | split: ','
  assign default_alts = 'סידור פריז — ורדים בגווני ורוד בקופסה של פלוריסטה;מתוך קמפיין פלוריסטה — זר ורדים בגווני יין עטוף בנייר קראפט;זר מנגינה קיצית — חמניות, בובנג ודלפיניום של פלוריסטה;מתוך קמפיין פלוריסטה — הידראנגאה ורודה על רקע סידורי פרחים;סידור קיץ טרופי — ורדים לבנים בקופסה של פלוריסטה;מתוך קמפיין פלוריסטה — זר פרחי שדה צבעוני ברחוב שטוף שמש' | split: ';'
-%}

<section class="ig-section">
  <div class="ig-inner">
    {%- comment -%}
      dir="ltr" is load-bearing, same reasoning as the footer's copyright line: an RTL heading
      reorders "#florista" into "florista#" because the brand name is the only strongly-
      directional run.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <h2 class="ig-heading" dir="ltr">{{ section.settings.heading | default: '#florista' }}</h2>

    <ul class="ig-grid">
      {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
        {%- liquid
          assign tile_url = block.settings.link | default: profile_url
          assign idx = forloop.index0
        -%}
        {%- if block.settings.image -%}
          <li class="ig-tile" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
            <a class="ig-link" href="{{ tile_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
              {{
                block.settings.image
                | image_url: width: 700, height: 700, crop: 'center'
                | image_tag:
                  class: 'ig-img',
                  loading: 'lazy',
                  widths: '350, 700',
                  alt: block.settings.image.alt
              }}
            </a>
          </li>
        {%- elsif idx < 6 -%}
          <li class="ig-tile" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
            <a class="ig-link" href="{{ tile_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
              <picture>
                <source type="image/webp" srcset="{{ default_assets[idx] | append: '.webp' | asset_url }}">
                <img
                  class="ig-img"
                  src="{{ default_assets[idx] | append: '.jpg' | asset_url }}"
                  alt="{{ default_alts[idx] }}"
                  width="700"
                  height="700"
                  loading="lazy"
                >
              </picture>
            </a>
          </li>
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endfor -%}
    </ul>

    {%- comment -%}
      Link text is the owner's, decided 2026-08-31: "עקבו אחרי האומנות שלנו" —
      no "instagram" in the copy and no visible handle; the destination says it.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <a class="ig-follow" href="{{ profile_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
      עקבו אחרי האומנות שלנו
    </a>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Florista Instagram",
  "tag": "section",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "להחלפת תמונה: לוחצים על אריח ברשימה משמאל ובוחרים תמונה חדשה. אריח בלי תמונה מציג את תמונת ברירת המחדל שלו."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "heading",
      "label": "כותרת",
      "default": "#florista"
    },
    {
      "type": "url",
      "id": "profile_url",
      "label": "קישור לפרופיל האינסטגרם",
      "info": "אם נשאר ריק: https://www.instagram.com/floristahaifa/"
    }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "tile",
      "name": "תמונה",
      "settings": [
        { "type": "image_picker", "id": "image", "label": "תמונה (ריבועית)" },
        { "type": "url", "id": "link", "label": "קישור (אם ריק — לפרופיל)" }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "max_blocks": 8,
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Florista Instagram",
      "blocks": [
        { "type": "tile" }, { "type": "tile" }, { "type": "tile" },
        { "type": "tile" }, { "type": "tile" }, { "type": "tile" }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
